<body>
    <h1>Power Order Splitting Solution Design for Salesforce Revenue Cloud =
Implementation</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"3655049433d1"><strong>Power Order Splitting</strong>=
&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"145c03ac159e">Solution Design Document&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"fa88c2b5ff29">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"5804e163f57b">Salesforce Revenue Cloud Implementation&nbsp;<=
/p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"facc8ce34016">
<li local-id=3D"c64e9ddcf16c">
<p local-id=3D"bb0746441c0d"><strong>Executive Summary</strong>&nbsp;</p></=
li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"33367fd6762d">This document outlines the solution design for=
 the Power Order Splitting feature within the Salesforce Revenue Cloud impl=
ementation. The feature automates the splitting of order lines for Power so=
lution group products when quantities exceed one, ensuring proper hardware =
and partition record management.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"5f6783468593">The solution supports two distinct splitting b=
ehaviors based on product configuration: sharing hardware across split line=
s or cloning hardware for each individual line. This flexibility accommodat=
es various business scenarios while maintaining data integrity and audit tr=
aceability.&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"f72ed4bb305d">
<li local-id=3D"7eebbeca1611">
<p local-id=3D"3f63e0cc7e09"><strong>Business Requirements</strong>&nbsp;</=
p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"ebb1fb38575a"><strong>2.1 Background</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"5e1d816424fa">Power products require special handling during=
 order processing. When a customer orders multiple units of a Power product=
 (quantity &gt; 1), each unit must be tracked individually for licensing, m=
aintenance, and hardware inventory purposes. This requires splitting the or=
der line into individual quantity-1 lines.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"8e2a48774716"><strong>2.2 Functional Requirements</strong>&n=
bsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ecd206ab-5a3f-4dc1-8f8c-d1244706b4bd">
<li local-id=3D"e33f2c23-b0f5-4114-a7ef-d79b751f5206">
<p local-id=3D"ecba4d54eb67">The system shall automatically split Power pro=
duct order lines when quantity exceeds one&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"be32fb1f-9d4e-47f2-b379-ffc3c3512cdf">
<li local-id=3D"54fa8862-4363-4949-aa34-143c75989228">
<p local-id=3D"db300b8fdfea">Each split line shall have a quantity of exact=
ly one (1)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"17769a6c-b7ba-471e-aede-110b6f011f66">
<li local-id=3D"e3cf8acd-1632-4705-a979-446445a6743a">
<p local-id=3D"65746cdc730f">Manual Discount Amount shall be divided evenly=
 across all split lines&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"7398fe59-268d-48a3-8ca4-d53e2a9a3271">
<li local-id=3D"9f06b0da-2041-4266-954b-cbbbdfbd7103">
<p local-id=3D"b2ad5a54af33">Displaced ARR shall be divided evenly across a=
ll split lines&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"cf9ff0d4-a167-40e2-82aa-ad0cbc3e528e">
<li local-id=3D"a49941b3-f3ce-42da-8271-b806b64c97a8">
<p local-id=3D"e72f6368ae07">Hardware records shall be shared or cloned bas=
ed on product configuration&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"6" local-id=3D"ac2d05c4-9a24-4680-a5bf-1bd6c05e7033">
<li local-id=3D"78808d14-c45e-4c20-b911-ff03bb631300">
<p local-id=3D"58518c0cf9ee">Partition records shall always be cloned for e=
ach split line&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"7" local-id=3D"f6d4efaf-ffbc-47b5-aa58-22d1c82f88cf">
<li local-id=3D"f6db46b2-3eb2-42fa-ad21-1b4106d5edd9">
<p local-id=3D"80b891c7a722">Split lines shall maintain a reference to the =
original order item for audit purposes&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"4207afbedeba"><strong>2.3 Split Type Behaviors</strong>&nbsp=
;</p>
<p local-id=3D"802a694fdce2">The system supports two split types, configure=
d at the product level:&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d42b7802-ebc8-4bdc-ad91-783=
fa850373d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52a8d06d-0b27-44f3-bde2-749efc0b72bf">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"7a5e219e-79c6-4af3-9=
cf7-709a257d7f31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58e8038a0930"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Split Type</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nb=
sp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"4ca18b2b-e7ab-4099-8=
a89-2e735d38f5d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a7b3d54c40ee"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Order Lines</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&n=
bsp;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"cd016d6b-bade-43af-b=
164-e460cd514d4b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"38296c793c62"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Hardware</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbsp=
;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"15dfa133-def0-473f-9=
34f-7125c852f62e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc8a00f7b635"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Partitions</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nb=
sp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f8431035-2a42-489f-977d-de6afc6df31d">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"2e9a716f-05e9-4a81-9=
e7d-5c99aa5a8654" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d56b2d7f153e">Order Line Only&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"5a232195-6c58-4c61-a=
382-88f6ce39f40b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8de542e35c7c">Split to qty=3D1 each&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"b942722c-2959-46ce-b=
469-530495962ddf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9789015b85f0">SHARED - all lines reference same hardware&nbs=
p;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"011838a3-b7d2-46b3-a=
624-578f1ec4d8ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb6e26f83aa9">CLONED - each line gets own partition&nbsp;</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a3610539-9dac-455e-965d-7d45b720a870">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"84779b9e-4bad-4f=
a5-99c7-f2b51d79cd68" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ac27652a7f2">Order Line and Hardware&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"50f436f0-eec1-43=
45-986c-cd57db669258" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76dbd775170f">Split to qty=3D1 each&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"81599591-8868-46=
a7-904b-7e42fbaca713" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"97bc17d32bab">CLONED - each line gets own hardware&nbsp;</p>=
</td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"15359066-0122-40=
f3-8c1c-056e3521566a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db0c361b6e86">CLONED - each line gets own partition&nbsp;</p=
></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"21b288725bb4">&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"d0de9569f8c9">
<li local-id=3D"485254c3633b">
<p local-id=3D"5fcc2f1a345f"><strong>Solution Overview</strong>&nbsp;</p></=
li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"1dde80049e6c"><strong>3.1 Architecture</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"471ee84c4445">The solution consists of an Invocable Apex ser=
vice that can be called from Salesforce Flows. This architecture provides f=
lexibility for integration with existing Quote-to-Order conversion processe=
s while maintaining testability and separation of concerns.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"baff9c06-9ef9-4eb5-bc0a-af1=
9cf17b8bd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7bbb2ac8-ee93-484a-a375-c4be20b67b8f">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"a4e527c6-53df-45cb-a=
b3a-59be2dc00a57" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"385bbec7955f"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Component</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&nbs=
p;</span></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#1b4f72" data-local-id=3D"a98681ad-3298-4ef8-8=
b1c-cd1565589fee" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"93fab818d17e"><strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inver=
se">Description</span></strong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-inverse">&n=
bsp;</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"07a36ac1-9b96-4a0a-a7c1-be6c7fc3f4ab">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"3738185d-57c6-40f2-8=
e2b-611d6222ee37" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47649a1aa0ec">PowerOrderSplittingService&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"1f0e38d5-c106-484b-a=
e34-9eff0d043ee9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce011a93b002">Main Apex service class with @InvocableMethod =
for Flow integration&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6741cd59-1ca6-4606-a5e4-eedb76103960">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"739d1c5c-eec9-4b=
6c-a4c6-5f93fca4dd00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c86a824f526">SplitRequest&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"45cc6c50-97d2-47=
34-82e3-b435a67bb2d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96b9897ee798">Input wrapper class containing Order ID for pr=
ocessing&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"803c38ce-0e4b-4bdc-a264-e5193757906b">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"c9c1c38e-c69c-441b-9=
90f-487d92070718" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc53fa2ec75a">SplitResult&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f8f9fa" data-local-id=3D"89322a1a-f075-47c2-a=
156-bcee65b4fe1a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f64817181c0">Output wrapper with success status, counts, an=
d error messages&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"09371eed-fc32-4036-956b-9674143d5bc1">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"ceffcaf2-383d-4d=
63-86de-afe66c782972" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa4ed54cb4ba">Quote-to-Order Flow&nbsp;</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"transparent" data-local-id=3D"b5b24d43-d0b0-43=
79-bd3e-525e84d42494" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"665537d6e88a">Existing flow modified to call the splitting s=
ervice post-conversion&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"8f3bdecb272e">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"2e8129ebe6e1"><strong>3.2 Process Flow</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f428ed67-cbff-4e73-8740-722eb55512ac">
<li local-id=3D"0c3d5b6a-d248-4bf1-85d0-6587d621d383">
<p local-id=3D"b2cc5ced9acf">Quote-to-Order conversion creates Order and Or=
derItems&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"ac323977-9d2e-4708-9a88-f17f884c2be7">
<li local-id=3D"75a38f15-d9bd-4556-bfe6-c47d74a9273b">
<p local-id=3D"906bff851b94">Flow calls PowerOrderSplittingService with Ord=
er ID&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"88e5e082-0acf-4070-8b56-0e8928c263ab">
<li local-id=3D"c9152959-76b3-412e-92b4-de6d3313067a">
<p local-id=3D"ef1fe33750b7">Service queries OrderItems where Product Solut=
ion_Group__c =3D 'Power' AND Quantity &gt; 1&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"1805746e-7dc0-40d6-a391-00f99a4fdfe9">
<li local-id=3D"5c19f0c9-886b-431e-8f74-b9443511b127">
<p local-id=3D"df6fac19fd51">For each qualifying line, determine split type=
 from Product.Power_Split_Type__c&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"510ae168-5c46-4dfe-b3d2-e42a68c69849">
<li local-id=3D"2aaf80ca-33da-4cda-83a9-02a4ac5368d3">
<p local-id=3D"1308c604e899">Clone Hardware records (if 'Order Line and Har=
dware' type)&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"6" local-id=3D"aea07d05-ce2e-4e1c-aff4-d138e5d74455">
<li local-id=3D"771c8698-a2ed-4ce9-b448-d3cf901d5bd1">
<p local-id=3D"ff9fa2b10a02">Clone Partition records (always)&nbsp;</p></li=
>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"7" local-id=3D"06877d43-ff11-409c-9387-ee5e73eddad5">
<li local-id=3D"39794b95-d202-4dc2-87fe-80369e1823cd">
<p local-id=3D"3c5df4c0b26b">Create new OrderItems with quantity=3D1, distr=
ibuted amounts, and proper references&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"8" local-id=3D"89bb8d9b-2f59-4160-b21f-fd08c9825d37">
<li local-id=3D"edfabd0d-1c3b-4ddd-ade1-e968ee39d46c">
<p local-id=3D"c6be6fdca52c">Update original OrderItem quantity to 1&nbsp;<=
/p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"9" local-id=3D"3724f139-7b9d-4952-a6b7-5368a46a166c">
<li local-id=3D"4818d71d-1320-4d1e-b943-920816876d28">
<p local-id=3D"5ea9e6d8a7e6">Return result with success status and counts&n=
bsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"98288a8103e2">&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"ec3610492346">
<li local-id=3D"20ea559e70b7">
<p local-id=3D"d8df33448efe"><strong>Data Model</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
