<p local-id=3D"df966353465d">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"cb5712cb02f4"><strong>4.2 Entity Relationship</strong>&nbsp;=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"fb55d0f2997a">After splitting, the data model relationships =
are as follows:&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"36f97a38-d51b-48fc-98b2-45ea7c21741f">
<li local-id=3D"a49ca266-e877-4720-a50a-8c35d0d36650">
<p local-id=3D"93fadbd6a916">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrder (1) =E2=86=92 OrderIte=
m (many) - Standard relationship=E2=80=8B&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"8052fc08-3290-490a-8522-c03bbfb36ba4">
<li local-id=3D"b99e5f59-1123-46d2-a01c-8cef6e9bedd8">
<p local-id=3D"e01f7274022e">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrderItem =E2=86=92 Hardware=
__c - Either shared (many:1) or unique (1:1) based on split type=E2=80=8B&n=
bsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"70aa4854-1c75-4c1f-b948-1fbb9340d4ec">
<li local-id=3D"53c8ad51-51a7-4a9a-9b93-81a7554a4388">
<p local-id=3D"525b742b6917">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrderItem =E2=86=92 Partitio=
n__c - Always unique (1:1) after splitting=E2=80=8B&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"96349ba2-e460-429b-aa15-82a7eeb198c1">
<li local-id=3D"fbc4b11a-1336-465e-ac9e-a5715034cdc3">
<p local-id=3D"714ad97a946e">=E2=80=8B=E2=80=8BOrderItem =E2=86=92 Original=
_Order_Item__c - Links split lines to original for audit trail=E2=80=8B&nbs=
p;</p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"e411232d059c">
<li local-id=3D"e755e16a8e85">
<p local-id=3D"8c1deae5ba60"><strong>Technical Implementation</strong>&nbsp=
;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"4de1159dea33"><strong>5.1 Apex Service Class</strong>&nbsp;<=
/p>
