<p local-id=3D"487c9b7c99f4">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"9788db794fc6"><strong>5.2 Key Design Decisions</strong>&nbsp=
;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"11810034-cd28-4735-8665-a27742e927fa">
<li local-id=3D"6e0df8fa-7510-40c9-a617-6a12be9b3fbc">
<p local-id=3D"6e79a341e7b6">Bulk-safe design: All DML operations are bulki=
fied to handle orders with many line items&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"1483cee2-bbe9-455a-b8d9-3a1e4c0dca5d">
<li local-id=3D"17d67a4c-baec-45c9-9adc-be4fdd48c309">
<p local-id=3D"c20f1c78b68a">Transaction integrity: Entire operation runs i=
n a single transaction with automatic rollback on failure&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"3a43f105-f76a-4542-a96d-e91777e11531">
<li local-id=3D"91fa04f2-ba2e-46d3-a23c-4d099d7121c2">
<p local-id=3D"55a716a8b703">Quantity preservation: Original quantities sto=
red in a Map before modification to prevent data corruption&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"d38589b0-ddac-455a-a161-f0c3b34de6a8">
<li local-id=3D"ac9a2f0b-bb07-404b-8e6c-8123444e1faa">
<p local-id=3D"c447047921f8">Even distribution: Currency amounts rounded to=
 2 decimal places with remainder applied to first split line&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"5" local-id=3D"defd1676-0646-4bce-9321-0bc1609cd4e9">
<li local-id=3D"263fb987-77e1-4120-93a6-d6f414b4cabd">
<p local-id=3D"bcbe06b1ec6b">Audit trail: Original_Order_Item__c and Is_Spl=
it_Line__c fields enable full traceability&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"ae37c537497a"><strong>5.3 Governor Limit Considerations</str=
ong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"03f4d805b128">The service is designed to operate within Sale=
sforce governor limits:&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"eee7f63c-4795-4b2c-b50e-69b007bf34fa">
<li local-id=3D"2a5c4f8f-bc30-4649-9da2-82beb872d134">
<p local-id=3D"e87208f43091">SOQL queries: Minimized to 4 queries regardles=
s of data volume&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"82c5e084-a43e-4b4d-a7c4-283328189f78">
<li local-id=3D"ea6c9a70-b069-4dd6-80fc-3ff4f07cbb0a">
<p local-id=3D"220db69c973f">DML statements: Batched inserts/updates for Ha=
rdware, Partitions, and OrderItems&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"787b5094-151d-4f4d-a121-f233efa29429">
<li local-id=3D"a7752fec-bc94-4c2a-85c7-a7b3909b30de">
<p local-id=3D"5b125cb4311f">CPU time: Linear complexity O(n) where n =3D t=
otal order items to split&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"86be54523e79">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"2649c6f12377">&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"8" local-id=3D"9e7296ba86d4">
<li local-id=3D"fa33e664ec50">
<p local-id=3D"0d7261c086e3"><strong>Appendix</strong>&nbsp;</p></li>
</ol>
